id: spectral-mark
name: Spectral
kind: conditions
# Not a Combat Condition: Spectral Monster's mark - the Incorporeal State is its own, read by (4).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Spectral Monster: Incorporeal by its effects - 6(bT) Ki at the start of each turn.
text: >
  Spectral Monster (4): If you are in the Incorporeal State due to the effects of Spectral Monster, spend 6(bT) Ki Points at the start of your turn.

---

[passive]
